<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters are intensifying attacks on Somali army units, including a clash with Turkish-trained troops and a deadly convoy ambush that killed many soldiers. The army also faced mortar shelling in Puntland that killed three civilians and wounded seven, and heavy losses were reported after a battle in Jameeca. Somalia denied that Turkish F‑16 aircraft struck its own positions during the clashes. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE40U2xka1ZmVW04THNGQXczdTJyQ0M4MV9tVXJnenZ3c1VRUlV0dWt1a3Z0cFp0dTF2Wml2QVhMRkVMZE1hVzhDTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQNzM4S1gyZ0paSEFQWmpOLUd6WmZsclZsQ0hsVkNlaE02SjdueENSd2xPOFV6bWRyYmszN2ZFamtSUmh2b2hKUUlNWDB0MFJfX3RnQUFOZVFNMExBZUNWd1U5dHRZLUJkMDdhZlQzMVZldGRlczU4d0JCcHg1NktFcllXTjRDM1BZdU5qQVk2dW5LVE1pMHZ0LTAyTU1uYkhqOWNhYlVzS2I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOVllCQjdhZnN2SHdNZDgwRzkwOE1qd1Ytam5VSWU1R0NhbUNBTnFDTk9pYXd0QmYzM19sT3ZZaXQzby1UZDdyOXZpMkJVYnRBdjBkNlo3RG9VdF85UFkxTW83dkIwZFRiRlJPcUdWSnB1RlQtX3p6Y1pNdmZUeEJPRXQ3d3l1NEN5bEktSzlNcFVlcEFrS3l5T1E1QzN3UlUwa18xVmdyQUUyalRLS0lWY1FUNmh0QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNYWhWM3I4ZUF5by00M2oxcG0yX1RSR1puT1pENl8wVnJUdndJMDFMUmlXUGZCcnI1ZGdsaHJJZ3RWdXdFZnBDcGNHZFo0MWNzeXVJcXBtZG0wY1k4M2poaGFCVlNOeF9NbDZHaUpZVXdERjlDRUhnYTIwS1kxdm02dUdzRjdrOVlpMlotOHBHZHAtdVAtZk1OUVROWHIzNUNTVmZRcHpIN29rcUF4Yk9IaVFyU3E3LUU2LXBJOUExMXNQd0pHWmMzZ3d3?oc=5&q